{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>TomatoFlex 是一款以番茄工作法為核心的生產力工具，主打簡潔靈活，適合需要專注工作、讀書或管理休息節奏的人士。它原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，並提供 iPhone、iPad、Mac 與 Apple Watch 版本。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-33.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>跨裝置同步與智能統計</h2>\n<p>TomatoFlex 提供 1 至 90 分鐘的工作與休息設定，並以 Apple Watch 鬧鐘及可操作通知提示節奏。用戶可暫停、停止或只完成部分番茄鐘，進入狀態時亦可略過休息。統計會自動整理專注與休息時段，支援無限歷史、匯出 CSV、每日專注時間追蹤及 iCloud 保存，並可在 iPhone、iPad、Mac 與 Apple Watch 之間同步，另備有小工具、錶面複雜功能與捷徑整合。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-43-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-44-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-45-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-46-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1242x2688bb-47-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1183\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：TomatoFlex</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/tomatoflex/id1500965952?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T13:01:18.913099+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":377,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T12:40:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T22:58:44.636744+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T12:58:35.760381+00:00","content_hash":"ae6cbdde161d866796d586c82bd718024b83b1b272de0966933cf74ccd1c5033","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}